WEBVTT

00:25.581 --> 00:28.543
There was a boy I used to be

00:31.505 --> 00:34.186
Who saw the world so simply

00:36.886 --> 00:39.808
Thought every road was straight and true

00:39.888 --> 00:43.872
Beneath the sky of perfect blue

00:48.796 --> 00:54.821
He thought that love was just a phrase

00:54.861 --> 00:58.684
For sunny easy golden days

01:00.666 --> 01:05.910
He called you all his guiding stars Before he

01:05.970 --> 01:06.110
knew

01:10.885 --> 01:15.028
But I learned the sky can fall away and turn a

01:15.128 --> 01:22.033
bright and sunny day to grey And in the static and

01:22.073 --> 01:26.257
the night you were my only guiding light, more

01:26.317 --> 01:33.352
than a feeling More than a name You were the fire,

01:33.372 --> 01:36.417
you were the flame That led me through the

01:36.497 --> 01:40.744
pouring rain And brought me back to life again

02:06.201 --> 02:09.502
I learned to wear a painted smile

02:12.103 --> 02:15.504
And walk a cold and lonely mile

02:17.804 --> 02:21.745
To build a wall of industrial sound On cold and

02:22.005 --> 02:24.366
unfamiliar ground

02:29.787 --> 02:33.008
I learned how silence has a way

02:35.862 --> 02:39.423
And how a heart can fill with hate

02:41.604 --> 02:48.226
I learned that trust can be a lie Beneath a cold

02:48.346 --> 02:55.788
and empty sky Two stars I hear held close and

02:55.828 --> 02:59.610
tight One shines a warm and distant light A

02:59.670 --> 03:02.090
friendly face on a glowing screen

03:05.257 --> 03:09.018
The miles can't ever come between The bond we

03:09.138 --> 03:13.359
made, the truth we know Helping a broken boy to

03:13.419 --> 03:19.601
grow And when the sky would fall away And turn a

03:19.701 --> 03:26.562
bright and sunny day to grey And in the static and

03:26.602 --> 03:30.944
the night you were my only guiding light More

03:31.004 --> 03:37.226
than a feeling, more than a name You were the

03:37.286 --> 03:40.927
fire, you were the flame That led me through the

03:40.987 --> 03:45.189
pouring rain And brought me back to life again

04:07.397 --> 04:07.778
you

05:13.063 --> 05:15.185
See you.

